      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "4. Taking into account the submissions made and on going through the impugned judgment of conviction as well as the role of this Appellant as it reveals from the evidence of the prosecution witnesses especially the victim (P.W.3) and her sister (P.W.4), we are not inclined to accept the prayer as advanced in the application.",
